# Asset meta-generated caches
# =============================
[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*
sysinfo.txt
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.app
crashlytics-build.properties

# =============================
# Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code cache
# =============================
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
